3f1b119-1dac-499c-830b-6decb20bb9aa" srcSet="
      https://static.babycenter.com/user/sfiIMoWPu2I9InrC/us-e3f1b119-1dac-499c-830b-6decb20bb9aa_w250.jpg 250w,
      https://static.babycenter.com/user/sfiIMoWPu2I9InrC/us-e3f1b119-1dac-499c-830b-6decb20bb9aa_w600.jpg 600w,
      https://static.babycenter.com/user/sfiIMoWPu2I9InrC/us-e3f1b119-1dac-499c-830b-6decb20bb9aa_w1000.jpg 1000w,
      https://static.babycenter.com/user/sfiIMoWPu2I9InrC/us-e3f1b119-1dac-499c-830b-6decb20bb9aa_w1600.jpg 1600w,
      https://static.babycenter.com/user/sfiIMoWPu2I9InrC/us-e3f1b119-1dac-499c-830b-6decb20bb9aa 2000w" loading="lazy" class="blurImg hiddenUntilLoaded mui-11z5mz2" data-next-fallback-onerror="fallback-srcset"/></picture><img alt="visually sensitive icon: eye with cross slash" src="https://assets.babycenter.com/ims/2020/07/ic_sensitive.svg" width="30" height="26" loading="lazy" class="sensitiveIcon hiddenUntilLoaded mui-11z5mz2"/></div></div></div><div class="postBody bodyLinks">I am 6 weeks 5 days pregnant high risk due to my age and a history of miscarriages I got my levels checked yesterday but this test is different than my original blood pregnancy test can anyone determine if this is a good reading or not far as I can tell it just reads I'm on my first trimester I go b</div><div class="timestamp finePrint">an hour ago by MamaDawkins3</div><div class="postActions mui-1u45zpb"><div class="mui-1u45zpb"><div class="leftSideCmntCount finePrint "><svg class="MuiSvgIcon-root MuiSvgIcon-fontSizeMedium commentIcon mui-q7mezt" focusable="false" role="img" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color:#C2C2BC" aria-label="Number of comments"><path d="M20 4v12H5.17L4 17.17V4zm0-2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v15.59c0 .89 1.08 1.34 1.71.71L6 18h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V4c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2"></path><title>Number of comments</title></svg><span>2</span></div><div class="leftSideReactions"><div class="mui-lycs4w"><div class="emojisWrapper mui-1f3bocu"><img src="https://assets.babycenter.com/ims/2023/12/ic_heart_Filled_rejuv.svg" alt="replied with hug" width="18" height="18"/></div><div class="count">1</div></div></div></div></div></div></li><li id="post-78751828" class=""><a class="mui-12mmxgd" href="/groups/a85/pregnancy">Pregnancy</a><div class="hoverTextOnly mui-8an92f"><div class="titleText"><a class="hoverText" href="/post/a78751828/sorry-for-the-picture">Sorry for the picture </a></div><div><div class="mui-1veg32a"><div class="postAvatar"><div class="containsLetter mui-1xg3d" size="20" aria-hidden="true">b</div></div><span class="nameAndGroup finePrint">By Bluey95 </span></div></div><div><div class="mui-1opmajx"><div class="mui-e0on0p"><picture class="hiddenUntilLoaded mui-1dhrdme"><source type="image/webp" srcSet="https://static.babycenter.com/user/xwCDRxtyaKrC6c2f/us-be0ed943-9ba8-4c68-95ab-491522bff513_h230.webp 600w,https://static.babycenter.com/user/xwCDRxtyaKrC6c2f/us-be0ed943-9ba8-4c68-95ab-491522bff513_h350.webp 2000w"/><img alt="post image" src="https://static.babycenter.com/user/xwCDRxtyaKrC6c2f/us-be0ed943-9ba8-4c68-95ab-491522bff513" srcSet="
