div class="titleText"><a class="hoverText" href="/post/a78751846/positive-opk-but-no-dominant-follicles-on-ultrasound-anyone-experienced-this">Positive OPK but no dominant follicles on ultrasound — anyone experienced this?</a></div><div><div class="mui-1veg32a"><div class="postAvatar"><div class="containsLetter mui-tm69gb" size="20" aria-hidden="true">k</div></div><span class="nameAndGroup finePrint">By KelseyNA </span></div></div><div class="postBody bodyLinks">took Letrozole 5 mg this cycle. I had two transvaginal ultrasounds on CD13 and CD16, and both showed no dominant follicles larger than 10 mm. My uterine lining was also thin.

